  Transcript rows (work package transcript-rows): home-chat.md §3.4, §3.9, §3.10, §8; DS §4.1 #2-#5, §4.2.
  Desktop copy verbatim; (Android) marks new strings. Ids follow HC §8 where only the transcript
  uses them; tool-row strings that CT §D also defines for the Tool detail screen use the chat_tool_
  prefix so the two packages never define the same name. Reused from other files (do not redefine):
  run_failed_*, cred_*, msg_fork_empty, msg_fork_title_suffix (strings_session.xml),
  tool_overline_output, tool_output_cd, tool_copy_output, diff_*_count (strings_terminal_diff.xml).
-->
